<div class="guide-styles" data-zaf-dynamic="article" id="guide-body" lang="en">Welcome to Wowhead's Pre-Raid Best in Slot Gear list for Destruction Warlock DPS in Wrath of the Lich King Classic for Phase 3. This guide will list the recommended gear for your class and role, containing gear sourced from Heroics, reputation rewards, and the new 10-man Raid loot added to Titan Rune Dungeons.<h2 class="heading-size-2" id="best-in-slot-gear">Destruction Warlock DPS Best in Slot Gear, Gems, and Enchants - Pre-Raid Phase 3</h2>When gearing, there are a multitude of different things to consider; different talent specializations, your currently equipped gear, and your raid composition all play a key part. Perhaps the biggest deciding factor of them all is Hit rating - having too much or too little Hit rating from either talents, gems, or buffs will result in you swapping in different pieces of gear or gems to reach the relevant Hit cap. You can learn more about stat caps and priorities by visiting the <a href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/guide/classes/warlock/affliction/dps-stat-priority-attributes-pve">Warlock Stat Priority Guide</a>, but here are some important things to note:<div class="box">
<ul class="first last">
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<b>Hit cap</b> is determined by the level of the target, with level 83 raid bosses requiring +17% chance to Hit, whilst level 80 trash mobs require only +4%.<br/>You should typically gear for bosses, but it may be worthwhile to have a specialized setup for clearing trash. <a class="disclosure-off" href="javascript:">Click here for a full table</a>
<div class="last" id="1" style="display: none;">
<div class="pad first"></div>
