<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_shadow_unsummonbuilding.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Suppression</span></a> + Hit Debuff</td>
