<h5 class="heading-size-5 first" id="horde-best-in-slot">
<div style="text-align: -webkit-center;">
<img alt="" class="no-border" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/icons/horde.png"/>
<span class="gem2"> Horde Best in Slot</span></div></h5>This is what our <b>theoretical</b> Pre-Raid Best in Slot setup would look like. This is based on simulating a specific scenario with <span class="c11">
<span class="icontiny lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/class_druid.gif");'>Balance Druid</span></span> with the <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=33602/improved-faerie-fire">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_nature_faeriefire.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Improved Faerie Fire</span></a> talent or <span class="c5">
<span class="icontiny lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/class_priest.gif");'></span>Shadow Priest</span> with <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=33193/misery">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_shadow_misery.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Misery</span></a> increasing our hit chance by 3%. As well as the provided talents in the embed. However, as with every theory, it doesn't always reflect reality. You are<b> unlikely to obtain all of these</b> items or for example, be in the caster group. As always you should <a href="https://discord.gg/8mrt6DE" target="_blank">sim</a> for yourself and your unique situation.<br/>
<br/>
