<h2 class="heading-size-2" id="best-bind-on-equip">Best Bind on Equip Items for Destruction Warlock DPS - Pre-Raid Phase 3</h2>Here we will cover several items which are Bind on Equipped, meaning are tradable and can be bought at the Auction House if listed. Some of these are crafted with expansive materials or are rare drops from raids. This often means that they won't be cheap, and most will be eventually replaced with raid gear. <br/>
<br/>The most notable of these items are the new craftable 245 item level pieces, whilst these will be expansive they come close too the best in slot gear for Warlocks. These are <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47604/merlins-robe">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_chest_cloth_64.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Merlin's Robe</span></a> and <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47586/bejeweled-wizards-bracers">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_bracer_32a.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Bejeweled Wizard's Bracers</span></a>. There are also a couple of Bind on Equipped drops inside <a href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/zone=4722/trial-of-the-crusader">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Trial of the Crusader</span></a> namely <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47291/shroud-of-displacement">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_cape_18.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Shroud of Displacement</span></a> and <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47278/circle-of-the-darkmender">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_ring_80.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Circle of the Darkmender</span></a>.<br/>
<br/>
