<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_chest_cloth_64.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Merlin's Robe</span></a>
<br/>
<img alt="" class="no-border" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/uploads/guide/images/27798.png"/> <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47603/merlins-robe">
