<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_scroll_04.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Pattern: Merlin's Robe</span></a></td></tr>
<tr>
